  "body": "## What changed\n\nRun heavy release tests after the two builds and before the debug suites.\nRun the heavy shared queue first, then run its isolated targets alone.\nUse the same order for the ordinary targets after the heavy phase.\nKeep duration sorting within each shared queue.\nKeep the existing isolation rules, job budget, step names, commands, and failure reporting.\n\nThe artifact counts are in the [issue comment](https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/issues/2372#issuecomment-6977710231).\nBoth red cut runs failed `app heavy: pocket3d_hsm`.\nThe post-merge counts include shared causes and repeated defects.\nThey do not establish an overall heavy-test failure rate.\n\n## Cause\n\nThe release plan put heavy targets after the debug suites.\nThe executor also put isolated heavy targets after the shared debug queue.\nMoving plan entries alone could not enforce the required order.\n\n## Tests\n\n- `heavy_tests::release_plan_runs_heavy_targets_before_debug_suites`: red before the fix, green after the fix.\n- `lanes_tests::release_executor_finishes_heavy_steps_before_debug_despite_history`: red before the fix, green after the fix.\n- Restore the original `plan.rs`: the plan pin fails. Restore the fix: it passes.\n- Restore the original `queue.rs`: the executor pin fails. Restore the fix: it passes.\n- Remove the `--release` condition: the executor pin fails. Restore the condition: it passes.\n- Remove the `--ignored` condition: the executor pin fails. Restore the condition: it passes.\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: green, 178 tests passed.\n- `cargo clippy -p xtask --all-targets -- -D warnings`: green.\n- Release dry runs keep all step names, working directories, and commands unchanged.\n- Step counts stay at 1094 without snapshots and 1096 with snapshots.\n- Heavy targets finish before debug targets in both dry runs.\n- `--only \"app heavy: pocket3d_hsm\"` still selects one unchanged step.\n- Reviewed each diff hunk. `git diff --check` is clean.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone. `git diff --stat upstream/main -- \"*.nc\" \"*.cl\"` is empty.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nThe full release gate and its heavy CAM tests did not run.\nThe cut workflow did not run.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nNone. No open PR changed the expected files at the overlap check.\n\nProcess change: yes\n\nEffort: medium\n\nChangelog: Run heavy release gate tests before debug suites while preserving isolation and full failure reporting.\n\nFixes #2372\n",
